  "title": "Alicia&#39;s Aloo Gobi",
  "description": "Alicia&#39;s aloo gobi recipe calls for tomatoes, chickpeas, and coconut milk for extra sauciness in a typically dry Indian potato and cauliflower dish.",
  "authors": [
    "Alicia"
  ],
